        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Some issues are worked on in a group, others in individual sessions. We talk through which suits you in the initial meeting.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We describe individual work on the <a href="/en/services/individual-therapy.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">individual therapy page</a>.</p>
